
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#102b46">
<title>CIT Technician</title>

<style>
* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #edf3f8;
  color: #183047;
}

header {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg,#102b46,#17618b);
  color: white;
  padding: 35px 22px;
  border-radius: 0 0 25px 25px;
}

.brand {
  font-size: 13px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  opacity: .8;
}

h1 {
  margin: 18px 0 8px;
  font-size: 29px;
}

header p {
  color: #d6e8f5;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.container {
  max-width: 850px;
  margin: 30px auto;
  padding: 0 18px;
}

.section-title {
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr);
  gap: 15px;
}

.card {
  background: white;
  padding: 23px 18px;
  border-radius: 17px;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: #183047;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 18px #18304712;
  transition: .2s;
}

.card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow: 0 9px 22px #18304720;
}

.icon {
  font-size: 35px;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.card h2 {
  font-size: 17px;
  margin: 0 0 7px;
}

.card p {
  color: #718294;
  font-size: 13px;
  margin: 0;
}

footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 35px 15px;
  color: #7c8b99;
  font-size: 11px;
}

@media(max-width:550px) {
  .cards {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="brand">CREATIVE INNOVATION TECHNOLOGY</div>
  <h1>🔧 CIT Technician</h1>
  <p>ระบบเอกสารและงานบริการสำหรับช่าง</p>
</header>

<main class="container">

  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>เมนูสำหรับช่าง</h2>
    <p>เลือกบริการที่ต้องการใช้งาน</p>
  </div>

  <section class="cards">

    <a class="card"
       href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSds7ZZmtMvBXN-AFuH0RIVGrhw3p2vGXr4zHj_ggMARlRWL5A/viewform?usp=sharing"
       target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <div class="icon">🛠️</div>
      <h2>เอกสารทำ PM</h2>
      <p>Preventive Maintenance</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card"
       href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Iu1eX9kAYmLXPEU52ql0tqyxAZVcmRX7?usp=drive_link"
       target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <div class="icon">📄</div>
      <h2>PDF PM</h2>
      <p>คู่มือและเอกสาร PM</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card"
       href="https://cit-service-calendar.netlify.app/"
       target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <div class="icon">📅</div>
      <h2>ปฏิทินงานบริการ CIT</h2>
      <p>CIT Service Calendar</p>
    </a>

  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  CREATIVE INNOVATION TECHNOLOGY CO., LTD.
  <br><br>
  CIT TECHNICIAN PORTAL
</footer>

</body>
</html>
